        "direction": "Player Vibe: Sinister. Lengthen or hook silhouette edges, lower the stance or brow, and make the resting expression sly rather than cute. Shape language may feel ominous, but the photographed subject remains the body. Idle stays a resting pose, not an attack wind-up; Battle may show the full menace. Never add horns, pentagrams, extra mouths, blood, or occult emblems the subject does not have."
