        "direction": "Player Vibe: Cute. Round silhouette corners slightly, enlarge readable eyes or sensory features, keep posture open and inviting, and make the resting expression friendly. Shape language may become softer and more compact, but the photographed subject remains the body. Idle stays a resting pose; Battle may show extra playfulness. Never add hearts, bows, blush stickers, clothing, plush seams, or accessories the subject does not have."
